    <note type="translation" xml:lang="ja">アフマド・ブン・アブドゥッラー・ブン・ウマル・アッ＝サルシー、後にアル＝カーヒリー。マーリキー派。サハラー居住。ハディース伝承学と理解において私（＝サハーウィー）に師事した者の一人。わずかに学問に励んだ後、貧困と必要性から教育で生計を立てた。</note>
    <note type="translation" xml:lang="en">Aḥmad b. ʿAbd Allāh b. ʿUmar al-Sirsī, then al-Qāhirī, of the Mālikī school, a resident of al-Ṣaḥrāʾ. He was among those who continuously adhered to me (al-Sakhāwī) in transmission and understanding, and he engaged in scholarly pursuits for a short while, then earned his living by teaching due to his poverty and necessity.</note>
